      "privateNotes": "",
      "publicNotes": "<p>A Bonded Soul companion in its Fiend base form. Link it to its owner with <strong>Sync Bonded</strong> on the owner's sheet: it then has the owner's level, AC, saves, Perception and Hit Points, and its Strikes use the owner's best attack modifier with their highest attribute to damage. Drag evolutions from the Apex Talents compendium onto it; the pool is 3 + the owner's level points, reallocated during daily preparations.</p><p>Darkvision and the unholy trait. Resistance to fire 5, 10 at the owner's 10th. At their 5th its Strikes gain the unholy trait and deal +1d6 spirit to holy creatures.</p>"
